               </li>
               <li class="option">
                 <input id="q2-ruby" name="q2" type="checkbox" value="ruby" data-correct="false">
                 <label for="q2-ruby">Ruby</label>
               </li>
             </ul>
           </fieldset>
         </div>

         <div class="form-field">
           <fieldset>
             <legend>3. Which of these are used in web development?</legend>
             <ul class="options">
